  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="transcription" xml:id="transcription_aad_0141" xml:lang="en">
        <div type="envelope">
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00606/" ed="1r" type="envelope"/>
          <ab hand="#hand_blue_auden">
            <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_220">Professor Hert<unclear>a</unclear> Staub</rs>
            <address>
              <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_514">1160 <foreign xml:lang="de">Wien</foreign>
              <lb/>Thaliastrasse 149/7</rs>
            </address>   
          </ab>
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00607/" ed="1v" type="envelope"/>
          <ab hand="#hand_blue_auden">
            <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1">W.H. Auden</rs>
            <seg hand="#print_black_auden">
              <address>
                <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_2">3062 KIRCHSTETTEN
                <lb/><foreign xml:lang="de">BEZ.</foreign> ST. PÖLTEN
                <lb/>HINTERHOLZ 6
                <lb/><foreign xml:lang="de">N.-Ö.</foreign>, AUSTRIA</rs>
              </address>
            </seg>
          </ab>
          <ab hand="#stamp_gray_wsl">
            <lb/><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_240"><foreign xml:lang="de">WIENER STADT- U. LANDESBIBL.</foreign> <space quantity="1" unit="char"/></rs>4
          </ab>
        </div>
        <div type="letter">
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00608/" ed="2r" type="sheet"/>
          <div type="letter_message" hand="#hand_blue_auden">
            <opener>
              <dateline>
                <date>
                  <lb/>May 18<hi rend="superscript">th</hi>
                </date>
                <seg hand="#print_black_auden">
                  <placeName>
                    <address>
                      <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_2">3062 KIRCHSTETTEN
                      <lb/><foreign xml:lang="de">BEZ.</foreign> ST. PÖLTEN
                      <lb/>HINTERHOLZ 6
                      <lb/><foreign xml:lang="de">N.-Ö.</foreign>, AUSTRIA</rs>
                    </address>
                  </placeName>
                </seg>
              </dateline>
              <salute hand="#hand_blue_auden">
                <lb/>Dear <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_220">Professor <unclear>S</unclear>ta<unclear>u</unclear>b</rs><unclear>:</unclear>
              </salute>
            </opener>
              <p>
                <lb/>I am a le<unclear>ttl</unclear>e al<unclear>a</unclear>rmed because I
                <lb/>cann<unclear>ot</unclear> find the <rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_513">Neugeddergasse</rs> in my
                <lb/>street map of <rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_1"><foreign xml:lang="de">Wien</foreign></rs>. Could someb<unclear>o</unclear>dy
                <lb/>possibly pick me up any time after
                <lb/>7.0.p.m at the Restaurant in the 
                <lb/><del rend="overstrike" hand="#hand_blue_auden">Wesb<unclear>b</unclear></del> <rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_309">Westbahnhof</rs> where I shall
                <lb/>be having my dinner.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/>Did I send you last year my poem
                <lb/><rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_329"><hi rend="underline" hand="#hand_blue_auden">Lines to D<hi rend="superscript">r</hi> Walter Birk on his retiring</hi>
                <lb/><hi rend="underline" hand="#hand_blue_auden">from General Practice</hi></rs>.<unclear>.</unclear> If not, I will
                <lb/>since it is of l<unclear>o</unclear>cal Au<unclear>s</unclear>trian interest.
              </p>
              <closer>
                <salute>
                  <lb/>Yours since<unclear>rely</unclear>
                </salute>
                <signed>
                  <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1">Wystan Auden</rs>
                </signed>
              </closer>
            </div>
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00609/" ed="2v" type="sheet"/>
          <div>
            <ab hand="#stamp_gray_wsl">
              <lb/><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_240"><foreign xml:lang="de">WI<unclear>E</unclear>NE<unclear>R</unclear> <unclear>S</unclear><gap unit="char" quantity="1" reason="illegible"></gap>ADT- U. LANDESBIBL<unclear>.</unclear></foreign></rs> <space quantity="1" unit="char"/>4
            </ab>
          </div>
         </div>
        </div>
    </body>
